<title>BRAZIL: Opening prices for May 7 Brazil coffee auction.</title>
<headline>Opening prices for May 7 Brazil coffee auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Opening prices for the 200,090 60-kg bags of coffee stocks to be auctioned by the Brazilian government at 1400 local/1700 GMT on May 7 are as follows, according to Banco do Brasil which is holding the sale.</p>
<p>Quantity is given in bags, price in Brazilian reais per bag.</p>
<p>    QTY	CROP	COLOR	LOCATION		     PRICE</p>
<p>    8,830   1987/88   Yellowish   Lucelia, SP		  138</p>
<p>   35,017   1987/88   Yellowish   Lins, SP		     138</p>
